                "message": "Replace cursor-intangible in the dashboard with keymap jumping\n\ncursor-sensor--move-to-tangible signals wrong-type-argument on every\nredisplay when cursor-sensor-tangible-pos finds no tangible position, and\nthe error is demoted inside redisplay, so it cannot be caught. TAB and S-TAB\nalready step through the buttons from the keymap overlay and the movement\ncommands are ignored, so the mode is dropped. The focus face no longer\nextends, and global-hl-line-mode is off in the dashboard buffer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U17WoSwrRGjp7q9svv9TBQ",
